==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|рѣ́зать||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|orv|рѣзати}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*rězati}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*rḗˀźtei}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*wreh₁ǵ-}}. Cognate with {{cog|cu|рѣзати}}, {{cog|uk|різати}}, {{cog|bg|режа}}, {{cog|sh|резати}}, {{cog|sl|rezati}}, {{cog|cs|řezat}}, {{cog|sk|rezať}}, {{cog|pl|rzezać}}, {{cog|hsb|rězać}}, {{cog|dsb|rězaś}}, and {{cog|grc|ῥήγνυμι}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ре́зать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-резать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|ре́зать|impf|pf=поре́зать,разре́зать,заре́зать,сре́зать,резану́ть<q:semelfactive>|vn=ре́зание<q:nomen actionis>,ре́зка<q:nomen actionis instantiae>,резня́<q:nomen actionis instantiae>,резь<q:nomen actionis instantiae>,резьба́<q:nomen actionis instantiae; nomen resultatis>,ре́зчик<q:nomen agentis>,ре́зальщик<q:nomen agentis>,ре́затель<q:nomen agentis>,резе́ц<q:nomen instrumenti>,реза́к<q:nomen instrumenti>|vadj=резно́й,ре́заный,ре́зальный,ре́зательный}}

# to [[cut up]], to [[cut open]], to [[slice]], to [[carve]]
#: {{pf|ru|разре́зать}}
# to [[slaughter]], to [[knife]], to [[kill]]
#: {{pf|ru|заре́зать}}
# ''(on wood or metal)'' to [[carve]], to [[cut]], to [[engrave]]
# to [[cut off]], to [[slice]], to [[chop]]
#: {{pf|ru|сре́зать}}
# ''(on a test)'' to give a failing [[grade]]
#: {{pf|ru|сре́зать}}
# ''(cause pain)'' to [[hurt]], to [[cut into]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[operate]], to [[cut open]]
# to [[irritate]], to [[offend]] ''(eyes)'', to [[grate on]] ''(ears)''
# {{lb|ru|nautical}} to [[pass close]], to [[shave]]
# to speak [[bluntly]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''ре́зать''' [[правда|пра́вду]] [[в]] [[глаз|глаза́]]|t=throw a harsh truth in one's face|lit=chop truth into the eyes}}

